        "sub": "{G4_NO_HEATING}",
        "text": "No heating: The property does not have a fixed heating system. Although no repair is currently required, the absence of fixed heating may result in cold rooms, condensation, and mould growth. It is also likely to adversely affect the property's Energy Performance Certificate (EPC) rating and may impact its marketability. You should consider installing a suitable fixed heating system.",
        "tokens": [],
        "when": [
          "cb_no_heating",
          "true"
